### Playback details

- Idle: 6 cels over 2 seconds; holds 333/333/334/333/333/334 ms. Static ready is the quieter fallback.
- Dodge: 45 ticks / 0.75 s; holds 10/5/3/3/3/5/6/10. Lantern: 73 ticks / 1.2167 s; holds 12/7/8/10/6/8/8/14. Neither loops. Lantern pulse lighting is baked into cel 5.
- Lunge: 54 ticks / 0.9 s. Selected review loops end by repeating 01_READY; original 08_READY remains preserved. DL omits faulty 06_RETRACT. Use the clip timeline rather than alphabetical file order.
- Run: 40 ticks / 0.6667 s. DR/UL/UR hold each of 8 cels for 5 ticks. DL uses 5/7/8/5/5/5/5; wrong-phase source cel 3 is excluded, leaving larger 2→4 spacing. No duplicate endpoint.
- Sweep: DR 1170 ms, DL 1045 ms, UL 945 ms, UR 940 ms. Follow ordered drawing IDs in animation.json, including intentional reuse and reordered blade motion. These are visual timings, not a shared hitbox/event contract.
- Hit: 30 ticks / 0.5 s; holds 3/2/3/2/2/4/5/9, then return to ready. Exact joins are unverified.
- Death: 90 ticks / 1.5 s, then hold the final drawing indefinitely. Do not loop. DR/DL are backward collapses; UL/UR are alternate kneel/extinguish presentations, not rear-view versions of the same collapse. Excluded damaged poses and failed supine trials are not selected.

Ticks above use a 60Hz clock; they do not represent 60 new drawings per second.

